  },
  {
    "line": 147,
    "column": 12,
    "type": "BACKTICK_STRING",
    "text": "`While vaccines are universally recommended, some clients may have contraindications to particular vaccines.<br/>Additional contraindications may be included in WHO position papers for the vaccine - Measles vaccines: WHO position paper (April 2017).`"
